{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login-Test
POST https://localhost:3002/logout

### GET Users
GET https://localhost:3002/users

### GET User Details
GET https://localhost:3002/users/admin

### POST new User
POST https://localhost:3002/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "mitgliedsid": "2",
    "username": "newuser",
    "passwort": "{{newUserPassword}}",
    "rolle": "THEKENDIENST"
}

### DELETE User
DELETE https://localhost:3002/users/newuser

